    <custom_item>
      type        : RPM_CHECK
      description : "OL09-00-000150 - OL 9 must not have the sendmail package installed."
      info        : "The sendmail software was not developed with security in mind, and its design prevents it from being effectively contained by SELinux. Postfix must be used instead."
      solution    : "Remove the sendmail package with the following command:

$ sudo dnf remove sendmail"
      reference   : "800-171|3.4.6,800-171|3.4.7,800-171r3|03.04.06a.,800-53|CM-7a.,800-53r5|CM-7a.,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000381,CN-L3|7.1.3.5(c),CN-L3|8.1.4.4(a),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF|PR.PT-3,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,DISA_Benchmark|Oracle_Linux_9_STIG,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|CM-7a.,NIAv2|SS15a,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.1,PCI-DSSv4.0|2.2.3,QCSC-v1|3.2,Rule-ID|SV-271466r1091110_rule,STIG-ID|OL09-00-000150,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-271466"
