    <custom_item>
      type        : RPM_CHECK
      description : "OL09-00-000430 - OL 9 must have the gnutls-utils package installed."
      info        : "GnuTLS is a secure communications library implementing the SSL, TLS, and DTLS protocols and technologies around them. It provides a simple C language application programming interface (API) to access the secure communications protocols as well as APIs to parse and write X.509, PKCS #12, OpenPGP and other required structures. This package contains command line TLS client and server and certificate manipulation tools."
      solution    : "Install the gnutls-utils package with the following command:

$ sudo dnf install -y gnutls-utils"
