    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
      description : "OL09-00-000495 - OL 9 must remove all software components after updated versions have been installed."
      info        : "Previous versions of software components that are not removed from the information system after updates have been installed may be exploited by some adversaries."
