    <if>
      <condition type:"AND">
        <custom_item>
          type        : RPM_CHECK
          description : "Check GDM installed"
          rpm         : "gdm-0.0.0-0"
          operator    : "gt"
          required    : YES
        </custom_item>
      </condition>

      <then>
        <custom_item>
          type        : CMD_EXEC
          description : "OL09-00-002101 - OL 9 must disable the graphical user interface autorun function unless required."
          info        : "Allowing autorun commands to execute may introduce malicious code to a system. Configuring this setting prevents autorun commands from executing."
          solution    : "Configure the GNOME desktop to disable the autorun function on removable media.

The dconf settings can be edited in the /etc/dconf/db/* location.

Update the [org/gnome/desktop/media-handling] section of the \"/etc/dconf/db/local.d/00-security-settings\" database file and add or update the following lines:

[org/gnome/desktop/media-handling]
autorun-never=true

