    </custom_item>

    <custom_item>
      type        : FIND_CMD
      description : "OL09-00-002419 - OL 9 file systems must not contain shosts.equiv files."
      info        : "The shosts.equiv files are used to configure host-based authentication for the system via SSH. Host-based authentication is not sufficient for preventing unauthorized access to the system, as it does not require interactive identification and authentication of a connection request, or for the use of two-factor authentication."
