InputTCPServerRun
UDPServerRun
RELPServerRun
module(load=\"imtcp\")
module(load=\"imudp\")
module(load=\"imrelp\")
input(type=\"imudp\" port=\"514\")
input(type=\"imtcp\" port=\"514\")
input(type=\"imrelp\" port=\"514\")

The rsyslog daemon must be restarted for the changes to take effect:

$ sudo systemctl restart rsyslog.service"
